    <author>
      <name>whymm</name>
    </author>
    <category term="Crypto" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/categories/Crypto/"/>
    <category term="crypto" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/crypto/"/>
    <category term="RSA" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/RSA/"/>
    <category term="数论" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/%E6%95%B0%E8%AE%BA/"/>
    <category term="格" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/%E6%A0%BC/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<blockquote><p>这是一篇<strong>示例文章</strong>，用来演示公式、代码和表格的排版。正式发布时请补上题目来源与求解过程截图。</p></blockquote><p>RSA 的数学结构很简单，但「参数选错」会衍生出一整棵攻击树。这篇笔记按<strong>已知信息</strong>分类，把最常考的那几支剪下来。</p><h2 id="一、参数一览"><a href="#一、参数一览" class="headerlink" title="一、参数一览"></a>一、参数一览</h2><table><thead><tr><th>场景</th><th>已知</th><th>攻击名</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>同一明文，两个互素的 e</td><td><code>n, e1, e2, c1, c2</code></td><td>共模攻击</td></tr><tr><td>e 很小且明文短</td><td><code>e=3</code>，<code>m^e &lt; n</code></td><td>低指数攻击（直接开方）</td></tr><tr><td>同一明文加密多组</td><td><code>e=3</code>，三组不同 <code>n</code></td><td>Hastad 广播攻击</td></tr><tr><td>d 很小</td><td><code>e</code> 很大，<code>d &lt; n^0.25</code></td><td>Wiener 攻击</td></tr><tr><td>p、q 距离很近</td><td><code>n</code></td><td>Fermat 分解</td></tr><tr><td>已知 d 或 φ(n) 的一部分</td><td><code>n, e, d</code></td><td>分解 n</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="二、共模攻击"><a href="#二、共模攻击" class="headerlink" title="二、共模攻击"></a>二、共模攻击</h2><p>同一份明文用两个不同的公钥加密，且 <code>gcd(e1, e2) = 1</code>，那么可以用扩展欧几里得算法直接恢复明文：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> Crypto.Util.number <span class="keyword">import</span> long_to_bytes</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> gmpy2 <span class="keyword">import</span> gcdext</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">common_modulus</span>(<span class="params">n, e1, e2, c1, c2</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    g, a, b = gcdext(e1, e2)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">assert</span> g == <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    m = <span class="built_in">pow</span>(c1, a, n) * <span class="built_in">pow</span>(c2, b, n) % n</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> long_to_bytes(<span class="built_in">int</span>(m))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注意：<code>a</code> 或 <code>b</code> 为负数时需要先求模逆，<code>pow(c, -a, n)</code> 在 Python 3.8+ 可以直接用。</p><h2 id="三、低指数攻击"><a href="#三、低指数攻击" class="headerlink" title="三、低指数攻击"></a>三、低指数攻击</h2><p>当 <code>e = 3</code> 且 <code>m^3 &lt; n</code> 时，密文没有发生模运算，直接开三次方即可：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> gmpy2 <span class="keyword">import</span> iroot</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">m, exact = iroot(c, <span class="number">3</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> exact:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(long_to_bytes(<span class="built_in">int</span>(m)))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果 <code>m^3</code> 略大于 <code>n</code>，暴力枚举 <code>k</code>：<code>m^3 = c + k*n</code>。</p><h2 id="四、Wiener-攻击"><a href="#四、Wiener-攻击" class="headerlink" title="四、Wiener 攻击"></a>四、Wiener 攻击</h2><p>当 <code>d</code> 过小时，<code>e/n</code> 的连分数展开会逼近 <code>k/d</code>。实现思路：展开连分数 → 逐项求收敛子 → 检验 <code>ed ≡ 1 (mod φ(n))</code>。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">wiener</span>(<span class="params">n, e</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">continued_fraction</span>(<span class="params">a, b</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">while</span> b:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">yield</span> a // b</span><br><span class="line">            a, b = b, a % b</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    num, den = <span class="number">0</span>, <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> q <span class="keyword">in</span> continued_fraction(e, n):</span><br><span class="line">        num, den = den, q * den + num</span><br><span class="line">        k, d = den, num</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> k == <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line">        phi = (e * d - <span class="number">1</span>) // k</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> phi &lt;= <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># 解 x^2 - (n - phi + 1)x + n = 0</span></span><br><span class="line">        b = n - phi + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">        disc = b * b - <span class="number">4</span> * n</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> disc &lt; <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">continue</span></span><br><span class="line">        s = isqrt(disc)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> s * s == disc:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> (b + s) // <span class="number">2</span>, (b - s) // <span class="number">2</span>, d</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">None</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="五、Fermat-分解"><a href="#五、Fermat-分解" class="headerlink" title="五、Fermat 分解"></a>五、Fermat 分解</h2><p><code>p</code>、<code>q</code> 接近时，<code>n = (a-b)(a+b)</code>，其中 <code>a = (p+q)/2</code>，从 <code>ceil(sqrt(n))</code> 开始往上找即可：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> gmpy2 <span class="keyword">import</span> isqrt</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">fermat</span>(<span class="params">n, limit=<span class="number">10</span>**<span class="number">6</span></span>):</span><br><span class="line">    a = isqrt(n) + <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> _ <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(limit):</span><br><span class="line">        b2 = a * a - n</span><br><span class="line">        b = isqrt(b2)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> b * b == b2:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">int</span>(a + b), <span class="built_in">int</span>(a - b)</span><br><span class="line">        a += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">None</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="六、实用工具"><a href="#六、实用工具" class="headerlink" title="六、实用工具"></a>六、实用工具</h2><ul><li><code>RsaCtfTool</code>：一把梭，覆盖上面绝大多数场景。</li><li><code>sage</code>：格攻击（Coppersmith、LLL）必备。</li><li><code>gmpy2</code>：大整数开方、求逆，比纯 Python 快一个数量级。</li></ul><p><strong>小结</strong>：拿到 RSA 题先别急着写脚本，把已知量列成表，对号入座。90% 的题都是这几个模板的变体。</p>]]>
